		{"id":"a91c881537c12a95","type":"text","text":"All they do is swim in circles.\nIt's such a small world?\nWhat if they want to leave?","x":223,"y":594,"width":261,"height":108},
		{"id":"e6aedf94502a69fb","type":"text","text":"They are with family, have food and shelter, what more could they need?","x":573,"y":594,"width":250,"height":108},
